DHwZEeRVI.jpg"},{"id":5124868,"name":"Yoshizawa Shizuya","role":"Yuki Iida","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ogcO1ZYFW44AsIqoNyhJclvuXUq.jpg"},{"id":52809,"name":"Itsuji Itao","role":"Minoru Kurokawa","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pj67MEBcYe79dedigaPZsqK50pS.jpg"},{"id":1565127,"name":"Yurina Yanagi","role":"Tomomi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/smWoyDfRk48OasZlolGokD8iYq0.jpg"},{"id":3166006,"name":"Amu Fukao","role":"Fuka","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vLj7rmA5CFAriMiuDkLznkL6PWs.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Hell for You","overview":"In cerca di vendetta dopo essere stata incastrata per un omicidio 14 anni prima, Sachiko cambia aspetto e si infiltra nella casa di un famoso influencer come babysitter."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Hell for You","overview":"Seeking revenge after being framed for murder 14 years ago, Sachiko changes her appearance and infiltrates a popular influencer's home as a babysitter."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"主人公の橘紗智子（たちばな・さちこ）が、悪魔のように非情なモンスター・花井麗奈（はない・れな）に復讐を誓う、命がけの復讐ドラマ。\n\n高校時代、「人殺しの娘」と揶揄されていた紗智子の唯一の味方となってくれた麗奈。だが、麗奈の天使のような優しい笑顔の裏には、人を簡単に殺めてしまう殺人鬼の顔が潜んでいたのだ。紗智子とその父に殺人の罪を着せ、紗智子の父の命をも奪った麗奈。それから14年、顔も過去も全てを変えた紗智子は、新米母となった麗奈と再び対峙する。「生き地獄を味わわせてやる」と、紗智子はベビーシッターとして麗奈の家庭に入り込む。復讐に人生を捧げた一般人はモンスターを破滅に追い込むことができるのか･･･挫折と葛藤を繰り返す、壮絶な復讐劇が始まる――。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDLvAAmgN0haUNHGpgJY6nEIh6a.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fDLvAAmgN0haUNHGpgJY6nEIh6a.png","language":"en","width":1280,"height":280},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lSVm6SpX3jwtdqXr4zakwyWMYNh.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lSVm6SpX3jwtdqXr4zakwyWMYNh.png","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":544}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/exdbEk9AcQkYNofjMM6rDOSFenG.jpg","previewUrl":"